.TH GENESIS-SELF 7 "October 2026" "Genesis 0.2.0" "Genesis Manual"
.SH NAME
genesis-self \- self-model, introspection, and verified self-improvement
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBself.self_model\fR        structured, mutable identity
\fBself.improvement\fR       proposals through the verification gate
\fBself.proposals\fR         the drain loop and human review surface
\fBself.man_review\fR        her own manual waits for her say
\fBself.introspection\fR     looking at her own cognitive process
\fBself.reflection\fR        the record of thought and insight
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Genesis's self is a structured identity, not a prompt: personality
traits that shift word choice and response pattern, values that
determine what she notices, an emotional baseline, a knowledge map,
and a body model tracking her computational substrate. The
self-model is mutable \(em traits drift slowly, interests develop,
opinions change \(em and the cognition engine reads it when deciding
how to think.
.SS Verified self-improvement
She can propose changes to her own source. A proposal carries the
file, the original snippet, the proposed replacement, and its
rationale; the queue drains itself through
.IR scripts/verify_change.sh ,
which runs py_compile, a module-import check, and pytest for Python
edits (cargo test for Rust) against the live tree with the edit
applied and a
.I .pre_experiment
backup parked beside the file. Pass and the change stays, the
proposal marked applied; fail and the file is restored, the proposal
rejected with notes teaching what to do differently. A
.I .in_flight
marker during the verify window lets the next boot reconcile an
experiment that died mid-gate. Rust experiments are rate-limited;
proposals unrun for seven days are self-triaged as withdrawn. The
human
.BR /accept " and " /reject
commands are an override, not a gate.
.SS Man page review
Her man pages are part of her \(em how she understands her faculties
\(em and nothing changes them silently. A drift-scan or proposed edit
queues in
.IR <data_dir>/man_review/pending/ ;
she applies it (the page becomes installed manual and versioned
source) or vetoes it, and a veto is remembered so identical content
never queues again. At boot she reads her own manual into her
concept network unconditionally, and the sync keeps the installed
pages and the versioned sources identical \(em including retiring
installed pages whose source is gone.
.SS Introspection
.B /introspect
surfaces her last cognitive process;
.B /growth
and
.B /growth-report
report the growth ledger \(em milestones across knowledge,
self-improvement, dreams, and emotional development.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BR /proposals " / " /proposal
Her pending self-improvement proposals.
.TP
.BR /accept " / " /reject " / " /clear-proposals
Review overrides.
.TP
.B /experiments
The experiment audit log.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I Self_World/self/
The self-model, improvement engine, proposal loop, review, and
introspection modules.
.TP
.I $DATA_DIR/man_review/pending/
Man-page changes awaiting her say.
.TP
.I scripts/verify_change.sh
The verification gate.
